   127	
   128	# Directory-level anchors we SET to the isolated tree. ``CEO_AUDIT_LOG_DIR`` is
   129	# the PRIMARY resolver for every audit path — ``audit_emit._audit_dir`` /
   130	# ``audit_hmac._audit_dir_from_env`` / ``spool_writer._state_dir`` all honor it
   131	# FIRST. ``HOME`` is the *fallback* the resolvers reach when ``CEO_AUDIT_LOG_DIR``
   132	# is absent. We redirect BOTH (plus ``CEO_PROJECT_STATE_DIR``) and CLEAR the
   133	# per-file overrides, so the entire audit/HMAC/spool surface resolves to the
   134	# isolated tree EVEN IF a test pops ``CEO_AUDIT_LOG_DIR`` mid-run (the fallback
